A task item keeps a lazy term one column below its child marker

```
* [ ] - :: t
     : a
     :: sibling
     tail
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled> 
    <ul>
      <li>
        <dl>
          <dt>t
: a
:: sibling
tail</dt>
        </dl>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
